WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.834
One correction is important before we start
PostgreSQL does not

00:00:05.861 --> 00:00:11.571
use DATEADD and DATEDIFF as native functions Instead
PostgreSQL

00:00:11.598 --> 00:00:17.558
commonly uses date or timestamp subtraction INTERVAL
values EXTRACT DATE_TRUNC AGE

00:00:17.729 --> 00:00:23.868
TO_DATE TO_TIMESTAMP and TO_CHAR The

00:00:23.895 --> 00:00:29.487
underlying analytical ideas are portable but the SQL
syntax depends on the database system
